-Install gnuplot if you do not have already: on Linux run "sudo apt install gnuplot" in the terminal
-Install TeX Live if you do not have already: on Linux run "sudo apt-get install texlive" (if this is not enough: "sudo apt-get install texlive-full", but this will take LONG)
-Run "./D15.48_NEW.sh" in the terminal
-Then a file called "D15.48_me_NEW" should be created in this directory
-Also a graphic called "D15.48_pr_NEW.pdf" in the "Plots" folder should be created (compare with the supposed outcome in the folder "Supposed_Outcome")
